{"name":"Delselar","status":"ok","title":"Delselar","pageId":123948,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Delselar</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p9_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p9-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3.M_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3.M-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-SK-p129-130_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p129-130-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"alt spelling\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Alt. spelling</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Dolselar</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aliases\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The City of Succulent Jewels</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">City</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thindol\" title=\"Thindol\">Thindol</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Chultan_Peninsula\" title=\"Chultan Peninsula\">Chultan Peninsula</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">76,412 in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Yuan-ti\" title=\"Yuan-ti\">Yuan-ti</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Delselar\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Delselar\">Organizations in  Delselar</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"DPL-purge plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Category_intersection_jump?DPL_cat1=Locations_in__Delselar&DPL_cat2=Bodies_of_water&action=purge\">Bodies of water  in  Delselar</a></span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Delselar</b>, also known locally as <b>Dolselar</b> and the <b>City of Succulent Jewels</b><sup id=\"cite_ref-SK-p129-130_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p129-130-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>, was a large city found in southern <a href=\"/wiki/Thindol\" title=\"Thindol\">Thindol</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Chultan_Peninsula\" title=\"Chultan Peninsula\">Chultan Peninsula</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p9_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p9-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Activities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Activities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Rumors_&_Legends\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rumors &amp; Legends</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delselar?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Delselar was founded on the southern border of the <a href=\"/wiki/Guthland\" title=\"Guthland\">Guthland</a> near the mouth of the <a href=\"/wiki/Thingulph\" title=\"Thingulph\">Thingulph</a> along the southern bank of the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Dolsel\" title=\"River Dolsel\">River Dolsel</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRA-p9_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRA-p9-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3.M_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3.M-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-SK-p129-130_3-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p129-130-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delselar?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Delselar was unwalled, stretching for 3 miles  (4.8 kilometers) along the banks of the river. The vast majority of structures within Delselar were within a stone's throw from the water.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SK-p129-130_3-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p129-130-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Activities\">Activities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Activities\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delselar?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Activities\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Agents from <a href=\"/wiki/House_Jennestas\" title=\"House Jennestas\">House Jennestas</a> infiltrated the city during the 1370s <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>, bringing a large number of dangerous <a href=\"/wiki/Snake\" title=\"Snake\">snakes</a> with them to populate the grasslands surrounding the city. The Jennestas also hid magical effects within the city that attracted the snakes, resulting in a much higher number of fatalities from the serpents' encounters with the citizens.<sup id=\"cite_ref-SK-p129-130_3-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p129-130-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Rumors_.26_Legends\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rumors_&_Legends\">Rumors &amp; Legends</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Rumors & Legends\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delselar?veaction=edit&section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Rumors & Legends\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As series of tunnels beneath the city connected to the <a href=\"/wiki/Pit_of_Vipers\" title=\"Pit of Vipers\">Pit of Vipers</a> temple in the <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Jungles\" title=\"Black Jungles\">Black Jungles</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-PaP-p86_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-PaP-p86-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delselar?veaction=edit&section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Delselar?veaction=edit&section=6\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRA-p9-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRA-p9_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRA-p9_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRA-p9_1-2\">1.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karen_Wynn_Fonstad\" title=\"Karen Wynn Fonstad\">Karen Wynn Fonstad</a>&#160;(August 1990). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Forgotten_Realms_Atlas\" title=\"The Forgotten Realms Atlas\">The Forgotten Realms Atlas</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 9. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0880388573\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0880388573\">978-0880388573</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCS3.M-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3.M_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3.M_2-1\">2.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Map included in&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a>, <a href=\"/